  m_text: "Here\u2019s the Kris for today\u2019s artifact. Reminds me of a big discovery
    she did several years ago... Would you want to take a picture and maybe send
    it to her? Might cheer her up!\n\n-Ms. Maya"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
